<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Simple Site</title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            text-align: center;
            background-color: #f4f4f4;
        }
        header {
            background: #333;
            color: #fff;
            padding: 1rem;
        }
        nav {
            margin: 1rem 0;
        }
        nav a {
            margin: 0 10px;
            text-decoration: none;
            color: #333;
        }
        section {
            padding: 2rem;
        }
        footer {
            background: #333;
            color: #fff;
            padding: 1rem;
            position: fixed;
            bottom: 0;
            width: 100%;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <header>
        <h1>Welcome to My Simple Site</h1>
    </header>

    <nav>
        <a href="#">Home</a>
        <a href="#">About</a>
        <a href="#">Contact</a>
    </nav>

    <section>
        <h2>About This Site</h2>
        <p>This is a basic example of a static HTML site with simple styling.</p>
    </section>

    <footer>
        <p>&copy; 2026 My Simple Site</p>
    </footer>
</body>
</html>
